msgid "Application functions for optimization {#application-functions-for-optimization}"
msgstr "Application functions untuk optimisasi {#application-functions-for-optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following quantum functions package the full optimization workflow, from problem mapping through hardware execution and post-processing, behind a managed interface. Rather than building and tuning your own circuits, you provide a problem definition, such as an objective function, a graph, or an industry-specific input like asset price data, and the function returns an optimized solution. These functions address optimization problems across domains, including unconstrained and constrained binary optimization, portfolio rebalancing in finance, and resource allocation problems defined on graphs.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi kuantum berikut mengemas seluruh alur kerja optimisasi, dari pemetaan masalah lewat eksekusi hardware sampai post-processing, di balik antarmuka terkelola. Alih-alih membangun dan menyetel circuit sendiri, kamu memberikan definisi masalah, seperti fungsi objektif, graf, atau input khusus industri seperti data harga aset, dan fungsi ini mengembalikan solusi yang dioptimalkan. Fungsi-fungsi ini menangani masalah optimisasi di berbagai domain, termasuk optimisasi biner tanpa batasan dan dengan batasan, rebalancing portofolio di bidang keuangan, dan masalah alokasi sumber daya yang didefinisikan pada graf.\n"

